Name Rio Note - Misc #5 Dying Jungle

Interactability_Text_Line_0 Visited Petrópolis for a date recently, and on my drive back, something bizarre caught my eye. I stopped the car and found a dead Jaguar in the forest. Strangely, the vegetation around it looked withered, not chopped, just dead. The air felt thick, making it hard to breathe. Couldn't make sense of it. What's going on over there?